{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6c19aa9dc5a833d9a33","chatId":"ef3f0f25445d44b58189ba2125311f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99327,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1772,"promptTokens":443,"completionTokens":106,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909097886365917,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6c19aa9dc5a833d9a32","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483905558,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6c19aa9dc5a833d9a32","chatId":"ef3f0f25445d44b58189ba2125311f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99327,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小利是一个经常被父母忽视的少年，但他为自己完美的学业记录感到自豪。他的父母告诉他，他们将因为弟弟的棒球比赛而不参加他的颁奖典礼。他的内心感到沉重，但还是独自走上了舞台。当他看向观众席时，他看到他的父母坐在第一排，微笑着为他鼓掌。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小利最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 自豪\nB) 嫉妒\nC) 伤心\nD) 失望\nE) 尴尬\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n小利为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他以为父母会忽视他时，他们却出现来支持他\nB) 他的完美学业记录给他带来了很多满足感\nC) 他的父母设法参加了他的庆祝活动和他哥哥的棒球比赛\nD) 小利独自在舞台上，喜欢这种关注。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909097886365917,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6c19aa9dc5a833d9a33","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483905555,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"83f13d02932b4240a8a1f0ff35fc1195"}